# Brand asset library (brand/) — 94MB of PNG renders.
# The files live in the working tree so they're to hand, but they are NOT
# committed: they're ChatGPT renders, not production files (see brand/README.txt
# — no true vector, no real .ICO, "192x192" is actually 1254x1254, and files
# named "-transparent" have no alpha). Committing 94MB of non-production
# raster into the app repo would bloat every clone for no benefit.
# brand/README.txt IS tracked — it carries the canonical colour spec.
brand/*
!brand/README.txt

